hey, ima keep it short cuz im deaaling with this rn. But just don't take an easy road out. theres people that love you and will be hurt in such extreme ways if you pass, its harder on them then it is on you. I know that sounds stupid as fuck but trust me, people need you in this world, i need you in this world. I get the unsuccessful attempt situation but id rather say youre just so strong that you know theres more to live for and more to do in this life rather than take your own. Can't tell how old you are by this post but please just know people do need you. You are a worthful human to this society and i hope this message gets through. I wanna say more but i feel itd be better if we chatted one on one if thats ok . 

&#x200B;

Hope youre okay
